@startuml
title Remove a location image or change the cover
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Library owner" as actor
box "Frontend - Loupe application / domain / api" #E0F2FE
participant "LocationGallery / RemoveLocationImage" as page
participant "LocationService" as client
end box
box "Backend - Loupe API application" #D1FADF
participant "LocationsController" as controller
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
participant "RemoveLocationImageCommandHandler" as handler
participant "Location" as entity
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
database "Library store" as db
participant "Durable work runner" as worker
end box
actor -> page : Confirm Remove for the selected image
page -> client : revision, imageId
client -> controller : DELETE /api/locations/{id}/images/{imageId}?revision
note over controller : API middleware authenticates; controller binds only
controller -> handler : MediatR dispatch RemoveLocationImageCommand
handler -> db : FOR UPDATE owned location [L2-056]
db --> handler : Owned state or 404 item_unavailable
alt revision matches
handler -> entity : Remove image; close position gap; cover moves to next image if it was the cover
handler -> db : Record image and preview keys as cleanup candidates; ImageSetRevision + 1; Revision + 1
db --> handler : Committed state
note over entity : Report untouched; Outdated derives from ImageSetRevision != report ImageSetRevision
handler --> controller : 200 LocationResult without the image
else revision stale
handler --> controller : 409 revision_conflict
end
controller --> client : Typed HTTP response / ProblemDetails
client --> page : Update state signals; gallery drops the image immediately
page --> actor : Saved / loaded state or retained-input error
worker -> db : CleanupWorker: candidates not referenced by any live row
worker -> worker : Delete bytes within 24 hours; remaining images stay readable
note over page, controller : Set as cover: PUT /api/locations/{id}/cover with revision and imageId changes only CoverImageId
@enduml
